1
00:05:12,631 --> 00:05:18,631
Thousands of years ago, there was a series of bizarre occurrences that many believe to have
been the Ten Biblical Plagues. No one thought they could happen again. Until now.

2
00:10:25,263 --> 00:10:31,263
The Reaping is a horror film directed by Stephen Hopkins.

3
00:15:37,894 --> 00:15:43,894
Katherine Morrissey, a former Christian missionary, lost her
faith after the tragic deaths of her family.

4
00:20:50,526 --> 00:20:56,526
Now she applies her expertise to debunking religious phenomena.

5
00:26:03,157 --> 00:26:09,157
When a series of biblical plagues overrun a small town, Katherine arrives to prove that a supernatural force
is not behind the occurrences, but soon finds that science cannot explain what is happening.

6
00:31:15,789 --> 00:31:21,789
Instead, she must regain her faith to combat the
evil that waits in a Louisiana swamp.

7
00:36:28,421 --> 00:36:34,421
Katherine, played by Hilary Swank.

8
00:41:41,052 --> 00:41:47,052
Doug, played by David Morrissey.

9
00:46:53,684 --> 00:46:59,684
Ben, played by Idris Elba.

10
