Loren McConnell, played by AnnaSophia Robb.

11
00:57:18,947 --> 00:57:24,947
Father Costigan, played by Stephen Rea.

12
01:02:31,578 --> 01:02:37,578
Sheriff Cade, played by William Ragsdale.

13
